OL,3,GNEWSACancer patient waited two days in
OL,4,Achair, son says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe son of an 83-year-old cancer
OL,7,Fpatient says she spent almost two days
OL,8,Fin a chair at A&E while waiting for a
OL,9,Fbed in hospital.
OL,11,FNigel Wass says he had to bring his
OL,12,Fmother fluids, turn off alarms and find
OL,13,Fa wheelchair to take her to the toilet
OL,14,Fduring "close to 48 hours" at Lincoln
OL,15,FCounty Hospital, because staff were
OL,16,F"run ragged".
OL,18,FOne in 20 patients using Lincolnshire's
OL,19,Femergency departments waited longer
OL,20,Fthan 12 hours for a hospital bed,
OL,21,Faccording to NHS figures for the year
OL,22,Fto October.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
