OL,3,GNEWSACancer patient waited two days in
OL,4,Achair, son says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnited Lincolnshire Teaching Hospitals
OL,7,FNHS Trust (ULTH) apologised and said it
OL,8,F"continued to implement improvements",
OL,9,Fincluding more rapid patient assessment
OL,10,Fand "timely patient discharges" to
OL,11,F"free up beds".
